WEBVTT

00:06:58.545 --> 00:07:02.072
that concessions confer
only a little humanity

00:07:02.096 --> 00:07:03.884
where full humanity is due;

00:07:04.355 --> 00:07:08.013
that crumbs are not the same
as a place at the table.

00:07:08.598 --> 00:07:09.918
Which is to say,

00:07:09.942 --> 00:07:13.072
you can forge meaning and build identity

00:07:13.096 --> 00:07:15.416
and still be mad as hell.

00:07:17.539 --> 00:07:19.180
I've never been raped,

00:07:19.204 --> 00:07:23.670
and I've never been in anything
remotely approaching a Burmese prison.

00:07:24.214 --> 00:07:26.047
But as a gay American,

00:07:26.071 --> 00:07:29.609
I've experienced prejudice
and even hatred,